tyle="width:9.9%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NOT NULL</span></td><td style="width:11.25%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">0</span></td><td style="width:36.48%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Tổng số Vàng người chơi đã chi tiêu tại Cửa hàng Lò Rèn trong phiên.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">11</td><td style="width:12.32%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">BlockHits</span></td><td style="width:12.38%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">INT</span></td><td style="width:11.94%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">int</span></td><td style="width:9.9%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NOT NULL</span></td><td style="width:11.25%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">0</span></td><td style="width:36.48%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Tổng số lần người chơi giữ Chuột Phải đỡ đòn thường thành công.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">12</td><td style="width:12.32%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">BlockedDamage</span></td><td style="width:12.38%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">INT</span></td><td style="width:11.94%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">int</span></td><td style="width:9.9%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NOT NULL</span></td><td style="width:11.25%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">0</span></td><td style="width:36.48%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Tổng lượng sát thương đã được giảm trừ nhờ cơ chế Đỡ đòn (<em>Block</em>).</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">13</td><td style="width:12.32%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PerfectParries</span></td><td style="width:12.38%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">INT</span></td><td style="width:11.94%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">int</span></td><td style="width:9.9%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NOT NULL</span></td><td style="width:11.25%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">0</span></td><td style="width:36.48%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Tổng số pha Phản đòn hoàn hảo (<em>Perfect Parry</em>) người chơi thực hiện được.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">14</td><td style="width:12.32%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">TrapHits</span></td><td style="width:12.38%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">INT</span></td><td style="width:11.94%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">int</span></td><td style="width:9.9%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NOT NULL</span></td><td style="width:11.25%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">0</span></td><td style="width:36.48%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Tổng số lần người chơi dẫm phải Bẫy Gai.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">15</td><td style="width:12.32%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">TrapDamage</span></td><td style="width:12.38%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">INT</span></td><td style="width:11.94%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">int</span></td><td style="width:9.9%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NOT NULL</span></td><td style="width:11.25%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">0</span></td><td style="width:36.48%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Tổng lượng máu người chơi bị mất do dính Bẫy Gai.</td></tr></table><h3 style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:13pt;color:#1e40af;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;margin:10pt 0 5pt 0;page-break-after:avoid;">5.3.4. Bảng <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">ShopPurchases</span> (Lịch sử giao dịch tại Cửa hàng Lò Rèn)</h3><p style="text-align:left;margin:5pt 0 8pt 0;line-height:1.45;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">Bảng <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">ShopPurchases</span> lưu chi tiết từng giao dịch mua Vũ khí hoặc Bình hồi máu của người chơi trong mỗi phiên.</p><p style="text-align:left;color:#1e3a8a;margin:10pt 0 4pt 0;font-size:12.5pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><strong>Bảng 5.5. Mô tả các trường dữ liệu của bảng ShopPurchases</strong></p><table style="width:16.0cm;table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse;margin:8pt 0 12pt 0;font-size:9.5pt;word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><tr><th style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">STT</th><th style="width:11.63%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Tên trường</th><th style="width:13%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Kiểu dữ liệu SQL</th><th style="width:12.15%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Kiểu dữ liệu C#</th><th style="width:9.83%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Khóa / Ràng buộc</th><th style="width:11.18%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Giá trị mặc định</th><th style="width:36.47%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Mô tả ý nghĩa</th></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">1</td><td style="width:11.63%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PurchaseId</span></td><td style="width:13%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">BIGINT</span></td><td style="width:12.15%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">long</span></td><td style="width:9.83%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PRIMARY KEY</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">IDENTITY(1,1)</span></td><td style="width:11.18%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Tự tăng từ 1</td><td style="width:36.47%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Mã định danh duy nhất của giao dịch mua vật phẩm.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">2</td><td style="width:11.63%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">SessionId</span></td><td style="width:13%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">BIGINT</span></td><td style="width:12.15%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">long</span></td><td style="width:9.83%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NOT NULL</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">FOREIGN KEY</span> (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameSessions</span>)</td><td style="width:11.18%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Không</td><td style="width:36.47%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Mã phiên chơi phát sinh giao dịch mua sắm này.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">3</td><td style="width:11.63%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">ItemType</span></td><td style="width:13%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NVARCHAR(20)</span></td><td style="width:12.15%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">string</span></td><td style="width:9.83%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NOT NULL</span></td><td style="width:11.18%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Không</td><td style="width:36.47%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Phân loại vật phẩm: <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">&quot;Weapon&quot;</span> (Vũ khí) hoặc <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">&quot;Potion&quot;</span> (Bình máu).</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">4</td><td style="width:11.63%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">ItemName</span></td><td style="width:13%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NVARCHAR(100)</span></td><td style="width:12.15%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">string</span></td><td style="width:9.83%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NOT NULL</span></td><td style="width:11.18%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Không</td><td style="width:36.47%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Tên vật phẩm (ví dụ: <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">&quot;Ngân Phong Kiếm&quot;</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">&quot;Phượng Hỏa Thần Kiếm&quot;</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">&quot;Bình Hồi Máu Huyết Ngọc&quot;</span>).</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">5</td><td style="width:11.63%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Rarity</span></td><td style="width:13%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NVARCHAR(30)</span></td><td style="width:12.15%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">string?</span></td><td style="width:9.83%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NULL</span></td><td style="width:11.18%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NULL</span></td><td style="width:36.47%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Bậc phẩm chất của vật phẩm (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">&quot;Hiếm&quot;</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">&quot;Sử Thi&quot;</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">&quot;Huyền Thoại&quot;</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">&quot;Thần Thoại&quot;</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">&quot;Tiêu Hao&quot;</span>).</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">6</td><td style="width:11.63%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Price</span></td><td style="width:13%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">INT</span></td><td style="width:12.15%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">int</span></td><td style="width:9.83%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NOT NULL</span></td><td style="width:11.18%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Không</td><td style="width:36.47%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Giá vàng của vật phẩm tại thời điểm mua (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">65 G</span> cho bình máu; <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">75 G</span> – <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">720 G</span> cho vũ khí).</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">7</td><td style="width:11.63%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PurchasedAt</span></td><td style="width:13%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">DATETIME2</span></td><td style="width:12.15%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">DateTime</span></td><td style="width:9.83%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NOT NULL</span></td><td style="width:11.18%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">SYSUTCDATETIME(​)​</span></td><td style="width:36.47%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Thời điểm thực hiện giao dịch mua (UTC).</td></tr></table><h3 style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:13pt;color:#1e40af;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;margin:10pt 0 5pt 0;page-break-after:avoid;">5.3.5. Bảng <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameEvents</span> (Sự kiện cột mốc Telemetry)</h3><p style="text-align:left;margin:5pt 0 8pt 0;line-height:1.45;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">Bảng <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameEvents</span> lưu trữ các sự kiện cột mốc quan trọng phản ánh tiến trình của người chơi trong phiên.</p><p style="text-align:left;color:#1e3a8a;margin:10pt 0 4pt 0;font-size:12.5pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><strong>Bảng 5.6. Mô tả các trường dữ liệu của bảng GameEvents</strong></p><table style="width:16.0cm;table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse;margin:8pt 0 12pt 0;font-size:9.5pt;word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><tr><th style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">STT</th><th style="width:11.36%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Tên trường</th><th style="width:12.55%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Kiểu dữ liệu SQL</th><th style="width:11.91%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Kiểu dữ liệu C#</th><th style="width:9.61%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Khóa / Ràng buộc</th><th style="width:10.93%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Giá trị mặc định</th><th style="width:37.92%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Mô tả ý nghĩa</th></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">1</td><td style="width:11.36%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">EventId</span></td><td style="width:12.55%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">BIGINT</span></td><td style="width:11.91%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">long</span></td><td style="width:9.61%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PRIMARY KEY</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">IDENTITY(1,1)</span></td><td style="width:10.93%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Tự tăng từ 1</td><td style="width:37.92%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Mã định danh duy nhất của bản ghi sự kiện.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">2</td><td style="width:11.36%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">SessionId</span></td><td style="width:12.55%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">BIGINT</span></td><td style="width:11.91%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">long</span></td><td style="width:9.61%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NOT NULL</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">FOREIGN KEY</span> (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameSessions</span>)</td><td style="width:10.93%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Không</td><td style="width:37.92%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Mã phiên chơi mà sự kiện này trực thuộc.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">3</td><td style="width:11.36%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">EventType</span></td><td style="width:12.55%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NVARCHAR(50)</span></td><td style="width:11.91%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">string</span></td><td style="width:9.61%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NOT NULL</span></td><td style="width:10.93%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Không</td><td style="width:37.92%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Tên mã sự kiện (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">login</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">game_start</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">level_start</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">level_​complete</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">level_failed</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">player_dead</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">boss_killed</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">game_exit</span>).</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">4</td><td style="width:11.36%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">EventTime</span></td><td style="width:12.55%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">DATETIME2</span></td><td style="width:11.91%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">DateTime</span></td><td style="width:9.61%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NOT NULL</span></td><td style="width:10.93%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">SYSUTCDATETIME(​)​</span></td><td style="width:37.92%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Thời điểm sự kiện xảy ra theo chuẩn UTC.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">5</td><td style="width:11.36%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Value</span></td><td style="width:12.55%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">INT</span></td><td style="width:11.91%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">int?</span></td><td style="width:9.61%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NULL</span></td><td style="width:10.93%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">NULL</span></td><td style="width:37.92%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Giá trị số nguyên đi kèm sự kiện (ví dụ: <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">LevelId = 1..3</span> hoặc <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PlayerId</span>).</td></tr></table><h2 style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:14pt;color:#0f172a;font-weight:bold;margin:13pt 0 6pt 0;page-break-after:avoid;">5.4. Khóa chính, khóa ngoại và chỉ mục (Indexes)</h2><p style="text-align:left;margin:5pt 0 8pt 0;line-height:1.45;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">Ngoài các khóa chính (<em>Clustered Primary Keys</em>) và 4 ràng buộc khóa ngoại (<em>Foreign Keys</em>) đã mô tả ở Chương 3, cơ sở dữ liệu được thiết lập <strong>5 Chỉ mục phi cụm (Nonclustered Indexes)</strong> trong tệp <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">02_CreateTables.sql</span> để tăng tốc các bộ lọc và phép nhóm dữ liệu trên Dashboard:</p><p style="text-align:left;color:#1e3a8a;margin:10pt 0 4pt 0;font-size:12.5pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><strong>Bảng 5.7. Danh mục các Nonclustered Indexes tối ưu truy vấn trong GameTelemetryDB</strong></p><table style="width:16.0cm;table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse;margin:8pt 0 12pt 0;font-size:10.5pt;word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><tr><th style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">STT</th><th style="width:18.1%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Tên Chỉ mục (Index Name)</th><th style="width:19.63%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Bảng áp dụng</th><th style="width:15.16%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Cột đánh chỉ mục</th><th style="width:41.38%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Tác dụng tối ưu hóa truy vấn</th></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">1</td><td style="width:18.1%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">IX_​GameSessions_​StartTime</span></td><td style="width:19.63%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">dbo.​GameSessions</span></td><td style="width:15.16%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">(StartTime)</span></td><td style="width:41.38%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Tăng tốc độ lọc phiên chơi theo khoảng ngày (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">from</span> – <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">to</span>) và gom nhóm số phiên chơi theo ngày (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">/​api/​Analytics/​sessions-​by-​date</span>).</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">2</td><td style="width:18.1%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">IX_​GameSessions_​PlayerId</span></td><td style="width:19.63%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">dbo.​GameSessions</span></td><td style="width:15.16%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">(PlayerId)</span></td><td style="width:41.38%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Tăng tốc độ đếm số người chơi duy nhất (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Distinct PlayerId</span>) và đếm tổng số phiên của từng người chơi (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">/api/Players</span>).</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">3</td><td style="width:18.1%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">IX_​GameSessions_​LevelId</span></td><td style="width:19.63%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">dbo.​GameSessions</span></td><td style="width:15.16%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">(LevelId)</span></td><td style="width:41.38%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Tăng tốc độ lọc phiên chơi theo từng bản đồ (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">?level=1</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">2</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">3</span>) trên tất cả các API của <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">AnalyticsController</span>.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">4</td><td style="width:18.1%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">IX_​GameEvents_​Session_​Type</span></td><td style="width:19.63%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">dbo.​GameEvents</span></td><td style="width:15.16%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">(SessionId, EventType)</span></td><td style="width:41.38%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Chỉ mục kép (<em>Composite Index</em>) giúp tăng tốc truy vấn dòng thời gian sự kiện theo <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">SessionId</span> và thống kê <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">level_start</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">level_​complete</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">player_dead</span> theo <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">EventType</span>.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">5</td><td style="width:18.1%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">IX_​ShopPurchases_​SessionId</span></td><td style="width:19.63%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">dbo.​GameSessions</span> / <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">dbo.​ShopPurchases</span></td><td style="width:15.16%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">(SessionId)</span></td><td style="width:41.38%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Tăng tốc độ kết nối (<em>JOIN / Where IN</em>) khi thống kê kinh tế vàng và lấy lịch sử mua đồ của các phiên chơi thỏa mãn bộ lọc.</td></tr></table><h2 style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:14pt;color:#0f172a;font-weight:bold;margin:13pt 0 6pt 0;page-break-after:avoid;">5.5. Kết nối Database</h2><p style="text-align:left;margin:5pt 0 8pt 0;line-height:1.45;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">Kết nối giữa ứng dụng Backend ASP.NET Core Web API và SQL Server được cấu hình thông qua chuỗi kết nối <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">DefaultConnection</span> trong tệp <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Backend/GameTelemetryAPI/appsettings.json</span>:</p><table style="width:16.0cm;table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse;margin:6pt 0 10pt 0;border:1pt solid #cbd5e1;border-left:3pt solid #1e3a8a;background:#f8fafc;"><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><div style="color:#1e3a8a;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:3pt;">[JSON]</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">{</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;ConnectionStrings&quot;: {</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;DefaultConnection&quot;: &quot;Server=​SEECONCAC\\SQLEXPRESS;​Database=​GameTelemetryDB;​Trusted_​Connection=​True;​TrustServerCertificate=​True;​&quot;</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;}</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">}</div></td></tr></table><p style="text-align:left;margin:5pt 0 8pt 0;line-height:1.45;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;"><strong>Giải thích các tham số trong chuỗi kết nối:</strong></p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Server=SEECONCAC\SQLEXPRESS</span>: Địa chỉ máy chủ và tên Instance SQL Server Express cục bộ.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Database=GameTelemetryDB</span>: Tên cơ sở dữ liệu đích.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Trusted_Connection=True</span>: Sử dụng cơ chế xác thực tích hợp của Windows (<em>Windows Authentication</em>), không cần lưu cứng tài khoản/mật khẩu SQL trong tệp cấu hình.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">TrustServerCertificate=True</span>: Cho phép kết nối mã hóa TLS với chứng chỉ tự ký của SQL Server trong môi trường phát triển.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:5pt 0 8pt 0;line-height:1.45;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">Trong tệp <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Program.cs</span>, chuỗi kết nối này được nạp vào <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameTelemetryContext</span> thông qua cơ chế <em>Dependency Injection</em>:</p><table style="width:16.0cm;table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse;margin:6pt 0 10pt 0;border:1pt solid #cbd5e1;border-left:3pt solid #1e3a8a;background:#f8fafc;"><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><div style="color:#1e3a8a;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:3pt;">[CSHARP]</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">builder.​Services.​AddDbContext&lt;GameTelemetryContext&gt;(​options =&gt;</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;options.​UseSqlServer(​</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;builder.​Configuration.​GetConnectionString(​&quot;DefaultConnection&quot;)​</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">);</div></td></tr></table><h2 style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:14pt;color:#0f172a;font-weight:bold;margin:13pt 0 6pt 0;page-break-after:avoid;">5.6. Các câu truy vấn thống kê</h2><p style="text-align:left;margin:5pt 0 8pt 0;line-height:1.45;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">Dưới đây là các truy vấn SQL đặc trưng tương ứng với các phép toán thống kê được thực thi trên cơ sở dữ liệu <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameTelemetryDB</span>:</p><h3 style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:13pt;color:#1e40af;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;margin:10pt 0 5pt 0;page-break-after:avoid;">5.6.1. Truy vấn thống kê các chỉ số tổng quan (Overview KPIs)</h3><table style="width:16.0cm;table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse;margin:6pt 0 10pt 0;border:1pt solid #cbd5e1;border-left:3pt solid #1e3a8a;background:#f8fafc;"><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><div style="color:#1e3a8a;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:3pt;">[SQL]</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">SELECT</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;COUNT(​DISTINCT PlayerId) AS TotalActivePlayers,​</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;COUNT(​SessionId)​ AS TotalSessions,​</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ROUND(​AVG(​CASE WHEN EndTime IS NOT NULL </div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;THEN CAST(​DATEDIFF(​SECOND,​ StartTime, EndTime) AS FLOAT) / 60.0 </div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;END), 2) AS AverageSessionDurationMinutes,​</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SUM(CASE WHEN LOWER(​LTRIM(​RTRIM(​Result)​)​)​ IN (&apos;win&apos;, &apos;victory&apos;, &apos;completed&apos;, &apos;thắng&apos;) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS TotalWins,</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SUM(CASE WHEN LOWER(​LTRIM(​RTRIM(​Result)​)​)​ IN (&apos;lose&apos;, &apos;loss&apos;, &apos;defeat&apos;, &apos;dead&apos;, &apos;thua&apos;) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS TotalLosses,</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SUM(​GoldEarned)​ AS TotalGoldEarned,​</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SUM(​GoldSpent)​ AS TotalGoldSpent,​</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SUM(​EnemiesKilled)​ AS TotalEnemiesKilled,​</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SUM(​CAST(​BossKilled AS INT)) AS TotalBossKills</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">FROM dbo.​GameSessions;​</div></td></tr></table><h3 style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:13pt;color:#1e40af;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;margin:10pt 0 5pt 0;page-break-after:avoid;">5.6.2. Truy vấn thống kê tỷ lệ hoàn thành và số lượt tử trận theo từng Level</h3><table style="width:16.0cm;table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse;margin:6pt 0 10pt 0;border:1pt solid #cbd5e1;border-left:3pt solid #1e3a8a;background:#f8fafc;"><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><div style="color:#1e3a8a;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:3pt;">[SQL]</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">SELECT</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;l.LevelId AS [Level],</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;l.LevelName AS StageName,</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SUM(CASE WHEN ge.EventType = N&apos;level_​start&apos; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS Starts,</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SUM(CASE WHEN ge.EventType = N&apos;level_​complete&apos; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS Completions,</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SUM(CASE WHEN ge.EventType = N&apos;player_​dead&apos; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS Deaths,</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CASE </div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;WHEN SUM(CASE WHEN ge.EventType = N&apos;level_​start&apos; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) &gt; 0</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;THEN ROUND(</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CAST(SUM(CASE WHEN ge.EventType = N&apos;level_​complete&apos; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS FLOAT) * 100.0 /</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SUM(CASE WHEN ge.EventType = N&apos;level_​start&apos; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END), 1)</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ELSE 0 </div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;END AS CompletionRatePercent</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">FROM dbo.Levels l</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">LEFT JOIN dbo.​GameEvents ge </div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ON ge.[Value] = l.LevelId </div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;AND ge.EventType IN (​N&apos;level_​start&apos;,​ N&apos;level_​complete&apos;,​ N&apos;player_​dead&apos;)​</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">GROUP BY l.LevelId, l.LevelName</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">ORDER BY l.LevelId;</div></td></tr></table><h3 style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:13pt;color:#1e40af;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;margin:10pt 0 5pt 0;page-break-after:avoid;">5.6.3. Truy vấn thống kê lượt mua và doanh thu vàng theo từng vật phẩm tại Lò Rèn</h3><table style="width:16.0cm;table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse;margin:6pt 0 10pt 0;border:1pt solid #cbd5e1;border-left:3pt solid #1e3a8a;background:#f8fafc;"><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><div style="color:#1e3a8a;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:3pt;">[SQL]</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">SELECT</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ItemType,</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ItemName,</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Rarity,</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Price,</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;COUNT(​PurchaseId)​ AS PurchaseCount,​</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SUM(Price) AS TotalGoldSpent</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">FROM dbo.​ShopPurchases</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">GROUP BY ItemType, ItemName, Rarity, Price</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">ORDER BY PurchaseCount DESC, Price ASC;</div></td></tr></table><p style="text-align:center;margin:10pt 0 3pt 0;"><span style="color:#1d4ed8;background:#eff6ff;font-weight:bold;padding:2pt 4pt;border:1pt dashed #1d4ed8;">[CHÈN HÌNH ẢNH: Kết quả chạy câu truy vấn thống kê trên SQL Server Management Studio]</span></p><p style="text-align:center;font-style:italic;color:#334155;font-size:12pt;margin:2pt 0 12pt 0;">Hình 5.2. Kết quả thực thi các câu truy vấn thống kê dữ liệu thực tế trên <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameTelemetryDB</span>.</p><hr style="border:none;border-bottom:1pt solid #cbd5e1;margin:12pt 0;"/><h1 style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:16pt;color:#1e3a8a;font-weight:bold;margin:16pt 0 8pt 0;page-break-after:avoid;">CHƯƠNG 6. XÂY DỰNG REST API</h1><h2 style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:14pt;color:#0f172a;font-weight:bold;margin:13pt 0 6pt 0;page-break-after:avoid;">6.1. Giới thiệu ASP.NET Core Web API</h2><p style="text-align:left;margin:5pt 0 8pt 0;line-height:1.45;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">Phân hệ Backend của dự án được xây dựng bằng <strong>ASP.NET Core Web API</strong> trên nền tảng <strong>.NET 10.0</strong> (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">net10.0</span>). Đây là framework phát triển dịch vụ web hiệu năng cao, mã nguồn mở của Microsoft, hoạt động theo kiến trúc <strong>RESTful (Representational State Transfer)</strong>.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:5pt 0 8pt 0;line-height:1.45;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">Trong hệ thống <strong>Game Telemetry System</strong>, dự án <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameTelemetryAPI</span> đảm nhận đồng thời 3 vai trò:</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:4pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;"><strong>1.</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Dịch vụ tiếp nhận dữ liệu (Ingestion Service):</strong> Cung cấp các Endpoint HTTP <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">POST</span> và <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PUT</span> tốc độ cao để Unity Game Client gửi thông tin xác thực, mở/đóng phiên chơi và đẩy các lô sự kiện Telemetry về cơ sở dữ liệu.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:4pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;"><strong>2.</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Dịch vụ phân tích dữ liệu (Analytics Service):</strong> Cung cấp các Endpoint HTTP <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GET</span> có hỗ trợ lọc đa chiều (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">from</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">to</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">level</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">limit</span>) để tính toán các chỉ số KPI, tỷ lệ thắng/thua, kinh tế vàng và chỉ số chiến đấu.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:4pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;"><strong>3.</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Máy chủ phục vụ giao diện tĩnh (Static File Host):</strong> Phục vụ trực tiếp ứng dụng Web Dashboard tại thư mục <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">wwwroot/index.html</span> thông qua middleware <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">app.UseDefaultFiles()</span> và <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">app.UseStaticFiles()</span>, giúp cả API và Dashboard chạy chung trên cùng một cổng (<em>Same-Origin</em>), loại bỏ hoàn toàn lỗi xung đột CORS khi gọi API từ trình duyệt.</p><h2 style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:14pt;color:#0f172a;font-weight:bold;margin:13pt 0 6pt 0;page-break-after:avoid;">6.2. Cấu trúc dự án Backend</h2><p style="text-align:left;margin:5pt 0 8pt 0;line-height:1.45;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">Dự án <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Backend/GameTelemetryAPI</span> được tổ chức theo kiến trúc phân lớp rõ ràng, tách biệt giữa tầng điều khiển (<em>Controllers</em>), tầng truy cập dữ liệu (<em>Data</em>), tầng mô hình thực thể (<em>Models</em>), tầng đối tượng truyền tải (<em>DTOs</em>) và tầng dịch vụ nghiệp vụ (<em>Services</em>):</p><table style="width:16.0cm;table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse;margin:6pt 0 10pt 0;border:1pt solid #cbd5e1;border-left:3pt solid #1e3a8a;background:#f8fafc;"><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><div style="color:#1e3a8a;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:3pt;">[TEXT]</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">Backend/​GameTelemetryAPI/​</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">├── Controllers/</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">│   ├── AnalyticsController.​cs      # 7 API tổng hợp &amp; phân tích dữ liệu cho Dashboard</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">│   ├── EventsController.​cs         # 3 API tiếp nhận sự kiện đơn lẻ, theo lô &amp; điều phối lưu DB</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">│   ├── HealthCheckController.​cs    # 1 API kiểm tra trạng thái kết nối SQL Server</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">│   ├── PlayersController.​cs        # 4 API đăng ký, đăng nhập &amp; truy vấn người chơi</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">│   └── SessionsController.​cs       # 3 API mở phiên, kết thúc phiên &amp; tra cứu phiên chơi</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">├── Data/</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">│   └── GameTelemetryContext.​cs     # Lớp DbContext cấu hình Fluent API cho 5 bảng SQL Server</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">├── DTOs/</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">│   ├── AnalyticsDtos.​cs            # 9 lớp DTO trả về số liệu thống kê (Overview, Level, Economy, Combat...)</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">│   ├── GameEventDtos.​cs            # 4 lớp DTO nhận sự kiện đơn lẻ, sự kiện theo lô &amp; phản hồi</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">│   ├── GameSessionDtos.​cs          # 3 lớp DTO mở phiên, đóng phiên &amp; thông tin phiên</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">│   └── PlayerDtos.cs               # 3 lớp DTO đăng ký, đăng nhập &amp; thông tin tài khoản</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">├── Models/</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">│   ├── GameEvent.cs                # Thực thể ánh xạ bảng GameEvents</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">│   ├── GameSession.​cs              # Thực thể ánh xạ bảng GameSessions</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">│   ├── Level.cs                    # Thực thể ánh xạ bảng Levels</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">│   ├── Player.cs                   # Thực thể ánh xạ bảng Players</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">│   └── ShopPurchase.​cs             # Thực thể ánh xạ bảng ShopPurchases</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">├── Services/</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">│   ├── PasswordHasherHelper.​cs     # Dịch vụ băm và kiểm tra mật khẩu chuẩn PBKDF2-SHA256</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">│   └── WeaponCatalog.​cs            # Danh mục 8 vũ khí chuẩn đồng bộ giữa Unity và Backend</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">├── wwwroot/</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">│   └── index.html                  # Giao diện Web Dashboard &quot;VANGUARD // TELEMETRY&quot;</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">├── appsettings.​json                # Cấu hình chuỗi kết nối SQL Server &amp; Logging</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">├── GameTelemetryAPI.​csproj         # Tệp cấu hình dự án .NET 10 &amp; các gói NuGet</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">└── Program.cs                      # Điểm khởi đầu ứng dụng, cấu hình DI &amp; Middleware pipeline</div></td></tr></table><h2 style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:14pt;color:#0f172a;font-weight:bold;margin:13pt 0 6pt 0;page-break-after:avoid;">6.3. Entity Framework Core</h2><p style="text-align:left;margin:5pt 0 8pt 0;line-height:1.45;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">Hệ thống sử dụng <strong>Entity Framework Core 10.0.14</strong> làm công cụ ORM (<em>Object-Relational Mapping</em>). Lớp <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameTelemetryContext</span> kế thừa từ <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">DbContext</span> khai báo 5 tập thực thể (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">DbSet&lt;T&gt;</span>) tương ứng với 5 bảng trong SQL Server:</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">public DbSet&lt;Player&gt; Players { get; set; }</span></p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">public DbSet&lt;Level&gt; Levels { get; set; }</span></p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">public DbSet&lt;GameSession&gt; GameSessions { get; set; }</span></p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">public DbSet&lt;ShopPurchase&gt; ShopPurchases { get; set; }</span></p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">public DbSet&lt;GameEvent&gt; GameEvents { get; set; }</span></p><p style="text-align:left;margin:5pt 0 8pt 0;line-height:1.45;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">Trong phương thức <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">OnModelCreating(ModelBuilder modelBuilder)</span>, nhóm sử dụng <strong>Fluent API</strong> để định nghĩa chặt chẽ các ràng buộc:</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;Khai báo khóa chính cho cả 5 bảng và tắt cơ chế tự tăng (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">ValueGeneratedNever()</span>) cho <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Level.LevelId</span> vì mã bản đồ được định danh cố định là <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">1</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">2</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">3</span>.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;Thiết lập kiểu số thập phân chính xác <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">HasColumnType(&quot;decimal(4,2)&quot;)</span> cho <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">DifficultyMult</span>.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;Thiết lập giá trị thời gian mặc định trên SQL Server <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">HasDefaultValueSql(&quot;SYSUTCDATETIME()&quot;)</span> cho các cột <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">CreatedAt</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">StartTime</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PurchasedAt</span> và <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">EventTime</span>.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;Khai báo tường minh tên các ràng buộc khóa ngoại (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">FK_GameSessions_Players</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">FK_GameSessions_Levels</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">FK_ShopPurchases_GameSessions</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">FK_GameEvents_GameSessions</span>) cùng cơ chế <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">DeleteBehavior.Cascade</span> và <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">DeleteBehavior.SetNull</span> khớp 100% với kịch bản SQL.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;Đồng thời, trên các lớp Model (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Player.cs</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Level.cs</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameSession.cs</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameEvent.cs</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">ShopPurchase.cs</span>), thuộc tính <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">[JsonIgnore]</span> được gắn trên các thuộc tính điều hướng (<em>Navigation Properties</em>) và cột <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PasswordHash</span> để ngăn chặn lỗi vòng lặp tham chiếu khi tuần tự hóa JSON cũng như bảo vệ mật khẩu người dùng.</p><h2 style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:14pt;color:#0f172a;font-weight:bold;margin:13pt 0 6pt 0;page-break-after:avoid;">6.4. Kết nối SQL Server</h2><p style="text-align:left;margin:5pt 0 8pt 0;line-height:1.45;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">Trong tệp <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Program.cs</span>, ngoài việc đăng ký <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameTelemetryContext</span> với chuỗi kết nối <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">DefaultConnection</span>, hệ thống còn tích hợp một khối kiểm tra tương thích ngược tự động ngay khi máy chủ khởi động:</p><table style="width:16.0cm;table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse;margin:6pt 0 10pt 0;border:1pt solid #cbd5e1;border-left:3pt solid #1e3a8a;background:#f8fafc;"><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><div style="color:#1e3a8a;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:3pt;">[CSHARP]</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">using (var scope = app.​Services.​CreateScope(​)​)​</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">{</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;try</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;var db = scope.​ServiceProvider.​GetRequiredService&lt;GameTelemetryContext&gt;(​)​;​</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;db.​Database.​ExecuteSqlRaw(​@&quot;</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;IF OBJECT_​ID(​N&apos;dbo.​Players&apos;,​ N&apos;U&apos;) IS NOT NULL AND COL_​LENGTH(​N&apos;dbo.​Players&apos;,​ N&apos;PasswordHash&apos;)​ IS NULL</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;BEGIN</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ALTER TABLE dbo.Players</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ADD PasswordHash NVARCHAR(256) NOT NULL CONSTRAINT DF_​Players_​PasswordHash DEFAULT &apos;&apos;;</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;END&quot;);</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;catch (Exception ex)</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;app.​Logger.​LogWarning(​ex,​ &quot;Không thể tự động kiểm tra/cập nhật cột PasswordHash khi khởi động.&quot;);</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}</div><div style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:8.5pt;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.3;word-wrap:break-word;">}</div></td></tr></table><p style="text-align:left;margin:5pt 0 8pt 0;line-height:1.45;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">Cơ chế này đảm bảo rằng nếu máy chủ API được chạy trên một cơ sở dữ liệu phiên bản cũ chưa chạy tệp migration <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">03_AddPasswordToPlayers.sql</span>, hệ thống sẽ tự động bổ sung cột <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PasswordHash</span> mà không làm sập ứng dụng.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:5pt 0 8pt 0;line-height:1.45;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">Ngoài ra, để tối ưu tốc độ đọc cho các API thống kê không yêu cầu chỉnh sửa bản ghi, toàn bộ các truy vấn đọc trong <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PlayersController</span> và <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">AnalyticsController</span> đều sử dụng phương thức <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">.AsNoTracking()</span> của EF Core nhằm bỏ qua chi phí lưu bộ nhớ đệm theo dõi thay đổi (<em>Change Tracking</em>).</p><h2 style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:14pt;color:#0f172a;font-weight:bold;margin:13pt 0 6pt 0;page-break-after:avoid;">6.5. Các API nhận dữ liệu và xác thực</h2><p style="text-align:left;margin:5pt 0 8pt 0;line-height:1.45;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">Tuân thủ quy tắc mô tả chức năng, phần này giải thích chi tiết mục đích, cơ chế hoạt động, dữ liệu đầu vào (<em>Input</em>), kết quả đầu ra (<em>Output</em>) và bảng đặc tả kỹ thuật cho toàn bộ 11 API thuộc nhóm xác thực, quản lý phiên và tiếp nhận sự kiện.</p><h3 style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:13pt;color:#1e40af;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;margin:10pt 0 5pt 0;page-break-after:avoid;">6.5.1. Nhóm API Quản lý và Xác thực Người chơi (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PlayersController</span>)</h3><p style="text-align:left;margin:4pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;"><strong>1.</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Chức năng Đăng ký tài khoản (POST /api/Players/register):</strong></p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Dùng để làm gì:</strong> Tạo tài khoản mới cho người chơi từ màn hình <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">LoginScene</span> của Unity hoặc từ Bot giả lập.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Hoạt động như thế nào:</strong> Kiểm tra hợp lệ <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">ModelState</span> (tên từ 3–50 ký tự, mật khẩu từ 6–100 ký tự). Cắt khoảng trắng hai đầu của <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PlayerName</span>, kiểm tra trùng tên trong bảng <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Players</span> bằng <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">AnyAsync</span>. Nếu tên chưa tồn tại, gọi <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PasswordHasherHelper.Hash(dto.Password)</span> để sinh chuỗi hash <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PBKDF2-SHA256</span> (định dạng <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">$pbkdf2$100000$&lt;base64_salt&gt;$&lt;base64_hash&gt;</span>), lưu bản ghi <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Player</span> mới vào SQL Server.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Dữ liệu đầu vào:</strong> JSON <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">RegisterPlayerDto</span> gồm <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">playerName</span> và <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">password</span>.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Kết quả đầu ra:</strong> Mã <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">201 Created</span> kèm đối tượng <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PlayerResponseDto</span> (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">playerId</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">playerName</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">createdAt</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">totalSessions</span>); hoặc mã <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">409 Conflict</span> nếu trùng tên; mã <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">400 Bad Request</span> nếu sai định dạng.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:4pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;"><strong>2.</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Chức năng Đăng nhập (POST /api/Players/login):</strong></p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Dùng để làm gì:</strong> Xác thực thông tin đăng nhập của người chơi trước khi vào chọn nhân vật và bản đồ.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Hoạt động như thế nào:</strong> Tìm người chơi theo <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PlayerName</span> (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">AsNoTracking</span>). Nếu tồn tại, gọi <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PasswordHasherHelper.Verify(dto.Password, player.PasswordHash)</span> để trích xuất muối (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">salt</span>) từ chuỗi lưu trong DB, băm lại mật khẩu nhập vào với 100.000 vòng lặp và so sánh hằng thời gian bằng <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">CryptographicOperations.FixedTimeEquals</span>.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Dữ liệu đầu vào:</strong> JSON <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">LoginPlayerDto</span> gồm <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">playerName</span> và <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">password</span>.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Kết quả đầu ra:</strong> Mã <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">200 OK</span> kèm <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PlayerResponseDto</span> nếu đúng mật khẩu; mã <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">401 Unauthorized</span> nếu sai tên đăng nhập hoặc mật khẩu.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:4pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;"><strong>3.</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Chức năng Tra cứu người chơi (GET /api/Players/{id} và GET /api/Players):</strong></p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Dùng để làm gì:</strong> Lấy thông tin chi tiết của một người chơi theo <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PlayerId</span> hoặc danh sách toàn bộ người chơi kèm tổng số phiên chơi đã tham gia.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Hoạt động như thế nào:</strong> Truy vấn bảng <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Players</span> và đếm <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">p.GameSessions.Count</span>.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Dữ liệu đầu vào:</strong> Tham số đường dẫn <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">id</span> (kiểu <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">int</span>) hoặc không có tham số.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Kết quả đầu ra:</strong> Mã <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">200 OK</span> kèm <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PlayerResponseDto</span> hoặc <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">List&lt;PlayerResponseDto&gt;</span>.</p><h3 style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:13pt;color:#1e40af;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;margin:10pt 0 5pt 0;page-break-after:avoid;">6.5.2. Nhóm API Quản lý Vòng đời Phiên chơi (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">SessionsController</span>)</h3><p style="text-align:left;margin:4pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;"><strong>1.</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Chức năng Bắt đầu phiên chơi (POST /api/Sessions/start):</strong></p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Dùng để làm gì:</strong> Khởi tạo một phiên chơi (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameSession</span>) mới trong cơ sở dữ liệu ngay khi người chơi bắt đầu vào cảnh chiến đấu trong Unity.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Hoạt động như thế nào:</strong> Kiểm tra <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PlayerId</span> có tồn tại trong bảng <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Players</span> hay không. Nếu hợp lệ, khởi tạo đối tượng <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameSession</span> mới với <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">StartTime = DateTime.UtcNow</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">EndTime = null</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">Result = null</span> và lưu vào SQL Server để sinh mã <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">SessionId</span> tự tăng.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Dữ liệu đầu vào:</strong> JSON <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">StartSessionDto</span> gồm <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">{ &quot;playerId&quot;: &lt;int&gt; }</span>.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Kết quả đầu ra:</strong> Mã <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">201 Created</span> kèm <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameSessionResponseDto</span> chứa <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">sessionId</span> vừa cấp.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:4pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;"><strong>2.</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Chức năng Kết thúc phiên chơi (PUT /api/Sessions/{id}/end):</strong></p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Dùng để làm gì:</strong> Đóng phiên chơi hiện tại khi người chơi thắng trận, tử trận hoặc thoát game.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Hoạt động như thế nào:</strong> Tìm bản ghi <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameSession</span> theo <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">SessionId</span>. Cập nhật <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">session.EndTime = DateTime.UtcNow</span> và gán kết quả <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">session.Result</span> (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">&quot;Win&quot;</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">&quot;Lose&quot;</span> hoặc <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">&quot;Quit&quot;</span>), sau đó lưu thay đổi xuống SQL Server.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Dữ liệu đầu vào:</strong> Tham số URL <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">id</span> (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">SessionId</span>) và JSON <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">EndSessionDto</span> gồm <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">{ &quot;result&quot;: &quot;Win&quot; | &quot;Lose&quot; | &quot;Quit&quot; }</span>.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Kết quả đầu ra:</strong> Mã <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">200 OK</span> kèm <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameSessionResponseDto</span> đã cập nhật <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">endTime</span> và <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">result</span>; hoặc <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">404 Not Found</span> nếu không tìm thấy phiên.</p><h3 style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:13pt;color:#1e40af;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;margin:10pt 0 5pt 0;page-break-after:avoid;">6.5.3. Nhóm API Tiếp nhận và Điều phối Sự kiện (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">EventsController</span> &amp; <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">HealthCheckController</span>)</h3><p style="text-align:left;margin:4pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;"><strong>1.</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Chức năng Ghi nhận sự kiện đơn lẻ (POST /api/Events):</strong></p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Dùng để làm gì:</strong> Tiếp nhận một sự kiện Telemetry đơn lẻ từ Unity Client hoặc từ công cụ giả lập.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Hoạt động như thế nào:</strong> Tìm phiên chơi theo <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">dto.SessionId</span>. Nếu phiên tồn tại, gọi hàm điều phối <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">ApplyEventToSession(session, eventType, eventTime, dto.Value)</span>:</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;Nếu <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">eventType</span> thuộc tập 8 sự kiện cột mốc <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">CoreMilestoneEvents</span>, hệ thống tự động cập nhật <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">session.LevelId</span> (nếu <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">value</span> từ 1 đến 3), cập nhật <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">session.BossKilled = true</span> (nếu là <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">boss_killed</span>) và thêm một bản ghi vào bảng <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameEvents</span>.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;Nếu <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">eventType</span> là <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">weapon_purchased</span> hoặc <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">potion_purchased</span>, hệ thống tra cứu tên và bậc phẩm chất qua <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">WeaponCatalog.ResolveByPrice(safeValue)</span>, cộng <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">session.GoldSpent += safeValue</span> và thêm một bản ghi vào bảng <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">ShopPurchases</span>.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;Nếu <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">eventType</span> là <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">enemy_killed</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">gold_collected</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">block_hit</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">perfect_parry</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">trap_hit</span>, hệ thống cộng dồn trực tiếp vào các cột tương ứng của <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">session</span>.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Dữ liệu đầu vào:</strong> JSON <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">CreateGameEventDto</span> (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">sessionId</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">eventType</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">eventTime</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">value</span>).</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Kết quả đầu ra:</strong> Mã <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">201 Created</span> (nếu tạo bản ghi trong <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameEvents</span>) hoặc <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">200 OK</span> kèm <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GameEventResponseDto</span>.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:4pt 0 4pt 14pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;"><strong>2.</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Chức năng Ghi nhận lô nhiều sự kiện (POST /api/Events/batch):</strong></p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Dùng để làm gì:</strong> Tiếp nhận hàng loạt sự kiện được gom lô từ <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">TelemetryManager</span> của Unity trong một lần gọi HTTP duy nhất.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Hoạt động như thế nào:</strong> Tìm phiên chơi theo <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">dto.SessionId</span>, duyệt qua danh sách <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">dto.Events</span>, áp dụng <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">ApplyEventToSession</span> cho từng phần tử và chỉ gọi <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">_context.SaveChangesAsync()</span> đúng một lần ở cuối vòng lặp để tối ưu hiệu năng ghi đĩa của SQL Server.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Dữ liệu đầu vào:</strong> JSON <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">CreateBatchGameEventsDto</span> gồm <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">sessionId</span> và mảng <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">events</span>.</p><p style="text-align:left;margin:3pt 0 4pt 28pt;line-height:1.4;font-size:13pt;word-wrap:break-word;">&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Kết quả đầu ra:</strong> Mã <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">200 OK</span> kèm JSON <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">{ &quot;message&quot;: &quot;Đã ghi nhận thành công N sự kiện&quot;, &quot;count&quot;: N }</span>.</p><p style="text-align:left;color:#1e3a8a;margin:10pt 0 4pt 0;font-size:12.5pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><strong>Bảng 6.1. Bảng đặc tả các Endpoint nhận dữ liệu, xác thực và kiểm tra kết nối</strong></p><table style="width:16.0cm;table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse;margin:8pt 0 12pt 0;font-size:10pt;word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><tr><th style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">STT</th><th style="width:13.98%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Endpoint</th><th style="width:7.73%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Method</th><th style="width:30.03%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Request Body / Params</th><th style="width:28.51%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Response thành công (200 / 201)</th><th style="width:14.01%;border:1pt solid #475569;background:#1e3a8a;color:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;word-wrap:break-word;">Mã lỗi có thể gặp</th></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">1</td><td style="width:13.98%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">/​api/​HealthCheck/​db</span></td><td style="width:7.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">GET</span></td><td style="width:30.03%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">Không có</td><td style="width:28.51%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">200 OK</span>: <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">{ &quot;status&quot;: &quot;Success&quot;, &quot;message&quot;: &quot;Connected to SQL Server successfully!&quot; }</span></td><td style="width:14.01%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">500 Internal Server Error</span></td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">2</td><td style="width:13.98%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">/​api/​Players/​register</span></td><td style="width:7.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">POST</span></td><td style="width:30.03%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">RegisterPlayerDto</span>: <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">{ &quot;playerName&quot;: &quot;string&quot;, &quot;password&quot;: &quot;string&quot; }</span></td><td style="width:28.51%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">201 Created</span>: <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">PlayerResponseDto</span> (<span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">playerId</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">playerName</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">createdAt</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">totalSessions</span>)</td><td style="width:14.01%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#f8fafc;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">400 Bad Request</span>, <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">409 Conflict</span></td></tr><tr><td style="width:5.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;">3</td><td style="width:13.98%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">/​api/​Players/​login</span></td><td style="width:7.73%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">POST</span></td><td style="width:30.03%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">LoginPlayerDto</span>: <span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:10pt;">{ &quot;playerName&quot;: &quot;string&quot;, &quot;password&quot;: &quot;string&quot; }</span></td><td style="width:28.51%;border:1pt solid #94a3b8;background:#ffffff;padding:4pt 5pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word;"><span style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;background:#f1f